Troubleshooting Tips
VS Code Installation Issues
# If GPG key fails, try alternative method
curl https://packages.microsoft.com/keys/microsoft.asc | gpg --dearmor > microsoft.gpg
sudo mv microsoft.gpg /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/microsoft.gpg

# Clear apt cache if needed
sudo apt clean
sudo apt update
Virtual Environment Activation Issues
# If activation fails, check venv creation
python3 -m venv --clear venv

# Ensure correct permissions
chmod +x venv/bin/activate
Extension Installation Issues
# Install extensions with verbose output
code --install-extension ms-python.python --force

# Check extension directory
ls ~/.vscode/extensions/
Python Path Issues
# Verify Python in venv
ls -l venv/bin/python*

# Create symbolic link if needed
ln -s venv/bin/python3 venv/bin/python
